---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { AUTHOR, GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title="소개">
  <div class="shell about-page">
    <header class="page-heading"><h1>소개</h1></header>
    <div class="about-main prose">
      <h2>{AUTHOR}</h2>
      <p>취미로 운영하는 개인 블로그입니다. 기술을 공부하거나 논문을 읽으며 정리한 내용을 올립니다.</p>
      <p><a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <Icon name="arrow" size={15}/></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
